            modulo a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/congruence+subgroup"} congruence subgroup
            in direct analogy to how
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO-theory"} KO-theory
            arises as the
            = succeed "-homotopy" do
