                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{M}_{ell}(2)_0
            is the moduli stack of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+curves+with+level+structure"} elliptic curves with level structure
            for
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
