          %p
            First observe (see also (
            %a{:href => "#MahowaldRezk09"}> Mahowald-Rezk 09, section 2
            )) that for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+curve+with+level+structure"} level 3 structure
            we have
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/congruence+subgroups"} congruence subgroups
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
