            %p
              The inclusion of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nodal+cubic"} nodal elliptic curve
              with its
              = succeed "-worth" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
